WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.240
How did the One Piece world get the way it is?&nbsp;
What happened in this world, that looks very&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:11.880
artificial, that has dinosaurs, lost ancient&nbsp;
civilasations with the technology to travel&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:18.180
into space and a whole century of history&nbsp;
completely missing from the histroy books,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:24.660
during which the world changed forever and fell&nbsp;
under the tyranny of the celestial dragons.

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:32.160
For over 1,000 chapters, we’ve followed the&nbsp;
adventures of Straw Hat Luffy - but what happened&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.160 --> 00:01:45.480
before he set sail on his journey? We’ve gotten&nbsp;
tons of bits of pieces from characters’ tragic&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:53.220
backstories to glimpses of ancient history, but&nbsp;
with so much lore in the story it can be hard&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.220 --> 00:01:58.680
to remember all of those details. So today,&nbsp;
we’re going to go over the official timeline&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:58.680 --> 00:02:05.220
of everything that happened in One Piece before&nbsp;
Luffy finally set sail. We’ll cover everything up&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:12.000
to Roger’s execution, but we’ll have to save the&nbsp;
Great Pirate Era for the next installment in this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:17.700
series. I don’t know if you knew this, but One&nbsp;
Piece has a whole lot of story…before its story…

00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:23.460
A long, long time ago - long before we have any&nbsp;
official record keeping in the One Piece world,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:23.460 --> 00:02:29.340
we know a few things. We know that there were once&nbsp;
dinosaurs that ruled the lands that have mostly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:29.340 --> 00:02:35.340
gone extinct. Now they survive in pockets of the&nbsp;
Grand Line such as Little Garden, and of course,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:40.500
they live on in Ancient Zoan fruits like&nbsp;
those possessed by the Beast Pirates.

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:43.860
We also know that long before&nbsp;
we have any official dates,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:43.860 --> 00:02:50.160
there was an advanced civilization on the moon&nbsp;
that appears to be the ancient ancestors of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:50.160 --> 00:02:55.320
sky islanders and perhaps the Lunarians.&nbsp;
For now, though, we’re still waiting on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:59.700
confirmation - maybe our favorite archaeologist,&nbsp;
Nico Robin, will be able to help us out with that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:06.540
one. But now let’s get to the events that we&nbsp;
have accurate dates for straight from Oda.

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:13.020
Let’s start with the oldest known event in all of&nbsp;
One Piece. For this one we have to go back a whole&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:19.962
5,000 years, with the planting of the Tree of&nbsp;
Knowledge by the ancient residents of Ohara. Hey,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:19.962 --> 00:03:26.100
that’s me! Man, remembering that that tree was&nbsp;
5,000 years old, and that the library contained so&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:33.180
much of the knowledge from all of those millenia&nbsp;
makes Robin’s flashback hit that much harder.

00:03:33.180 --> 00:03:37.260
Moving up a whole millennium from the&nbsp;
Tree of Knowledge, we move to Alabasta,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:37.260 --> 00:03:43.920
where the palace in Alubarna was built 4,000&nbsp;
years ago. It makes sense that Alabasta would&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:43.920 --> 00:03:50.340
hold one of the oldest known events since we know&nbsp;
Alabasta was one of the kingdoms that originally&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:50.340 --> 00:03:56.700
formed the world government centuries ago. And&nbsp;
in Alabasta, we also learned a few pieces of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:56.700 --> 00:04:01.860
its history from Robin. When Crocodile has her&nbsp;
decipher the poneglyph, she doesn’t tell him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:01.860 --> 00:04:07.860
that it holds information about the ancient weapon&nbsp;
Pluton. Instead, she recites some other pieces of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:07.860 --> 00:04:13.920
Alabasta’s history from her memory. However, we’re&nbsp;
not sure exactly when these took place because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:19.020
they’re dated according to a different calendar&nbsp;
than the standard calendar used in One Piece.

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:24.480
Fun fact: Did you know that the worldbuilding of&nbsp;
One Piece is so detailed that they have multiple&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:24.480 --> 00:04:31.020
calendars? The standard calendar that the story&nbsp;
follows is referred to as “The Age of the Sea&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:31.020 --> 00:04:37.260
Circle” According to Robin’s information, on&nbsp;
the alternate “Age of Heaven” calendar, in 239,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:37.260 --> 00:04:45.300
Someone named Kahira conquered Alabasta. In 260,&nbsp;
the Bitein Dynasty of Taymar began its rule. In&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:45.300 --> 00:04:53.940
306, the Great Taph Temple was constructed. And&nbsp;
in 325, the great hero of Oltea, Mamudin…did&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:59.280 --> 00:05:00.960
something. What, we don’t know, because Crocodile&nbsp;
stopped her right there, realizing that he wasn’t&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:00.960 --> 00:05:06.420
getting the information he wanted. Of course,&nbsp;
it’s also possible that instead of reciting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:06.420 --> 00:05:10.800
actual historical information Robin was&nbsp;
just…lying and making all of that up.

00:05:12.420 --> 00:05:20.160
Skipping way farther ahead, to 1100 years ago, we&nbsp;
have the building of the City of Gold, Shandora,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:26.820
and its prosperous age on the Blue Sea. 100 years&nbsp;
after that, we have the birth of Zunesha. Around&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:27.420 --> 00:05:31.800
1000 years before the current story,&nbsp;
the Minks found Zou atop Zunesha’s back.&nbsp;

00:05:33.480 --> 00:05:41.460
And that’s when we get to the good stuff: 900&nbsp;
years ago, we have the void century. And I wish&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:41.460 --> 00:05:47.160
I could tell you more about what happened in this&nbsp;
100 year span, but we’ll just have to wait for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:47.160 --> 00:05:52.620
Oda-Sensei to reveal the true history. What little&nbsp;
we do know is this: The ancient kingdom ruled the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:58.020
world with the power of the ancient weapons,&nbsp;
but by the end of the void century they were&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:58.020 --> 00:06:09.300
replaced by the alliance of 20 kingdoms that would&nbsp;
become the World Government. The World Government&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:16.380
proceeded to erase all mention of the Ancient&nbsp;
Kingdom from history, including its name - the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:16.380 --> 00:06:22.140
only thing that remains of the kingdom’s history&nbsp;
are the (nearly) undecipherable poneglyphs.

00:06:30.600 --> 00:06:36.900
We don’t know how the Ancient Kingdom fell or how&nbsp;
the World Government took power, but surely once&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:36.900 --> 00:06:42.900
the story reaches Laugh Tale, we’re in for some&nbsp;
bombshell revelations. What we do know is that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:42.900 --> 00:06:49.140
during the Void Century there was a figure named&nbsp;
Joyboy who played a central role. His comrade,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:55.440
Zunesha, committed some terrible crime and&nbsp;
was sentenced to walk the ocean endlessly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:55.440 --> 00:07:02.820
for centuries. In this time, Joyboy also broke&nbsp;
a promise to the leader of Fishman Island to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:02.820 --> 00:07:08.340
work with Poseidon to raise the Noah. It was&nbsp;
also during this century that Lady Toki used&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:08.340 --> 00:07:14.460
the Time-Time fruit to fling herself into the&nbsp;
far future where she would meet Kozuki Oden.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:14.460 --> 00:07:20.220
In the Void Century, the great city of Shandora&nbsp;
also fell to the alliance of the Twenty Kingdoms,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:20.220 --> 00:07:26.040
however the Shandians remained on Jaya to&nbsp;
defend what remained of the City of Gold.

00:07:26.640 --> 00:07:31.860
After the Void Century, 800 years before the&nbsp;
current story, all of the rulers of the twenty&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:31.860 --> 00:07:37.860
kingdoms who form the World Government leave their&nbsp;
home countries to reside in Mariejois where they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:37.860 --> 00:07:43.320
and their descendants become the Celestial&nbsp;
Dragons, the rulers of the world. That is,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:43.320 --> 00:07:48.180
all but the ruler of Alabasta, who&nbsp;
remains on Sandy Island. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:48.180 --> 00:07:52.620
it does include the Donquixote family,&nbsp;
who leave the Kingdom of Dressrosa,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:52.620 --> 00:07:57.900
at which point the Riku family become its&nbsp;
new monarchs. The Riku family delivers an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:57.900 --> 00:08:01.710
apology to the Tontatta, who had&nbsp;
been enslaved by the Donquixotes.

00:08:01.710 --> 00:08:08.400
One hundred years after the Void Century, which&nbsp;
brings us to 700 years before the current story.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:08.400 --> 00:08:13.920
In this century, the World Government orders&nbsp;
the construction of a bridge on Tequila Wolf,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:13.920 --> 00:08:19.740
which is for an unknown purpose, and&nbsp;
is still being built to this day.

00:08:23.220 --> 00:08:29.940
Jumping ahead to 500 years ago, we have the&nbsp;
life and death of the Ancient Giant Oars,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:29.940 --> 00:08:33.900
whose body is preserved in the icy Northlands.

00:08:33.900 --> 00:08:36.900
Maybe he would have survuved had&nbsp;
he pressed the flaming red box&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:36.900 --> 00:08:39.480
that is the subscribe button. WE’ll never know.

00:08:39.480 --> 00:08:46.980
400 years ago, the adventures of Montblanc&nbsp;
Noland begin. He travels to Green Bit where&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:46.980 --> 00:08:52.860
he becomes a hero to the Tontatta. Later in his&nbsp;
voyages, he arrives on Jaya, where he befriends&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:52.860 --> 00:08:57.840
Kalgara. However, four years later, when he&nbsp;
brings the King of Lvneel to the City of Gold,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:57.840 --> 00:09:04.260
Shandora had already been shot into Skypiea by&nbsp;
the knock-up stream. Thinking Noland a liar,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:04.260 --> 00:09:09.660
the King has him executed, tarnishing&nbsp;
the Montblanc name for centuries.

00:09:09.660 --> 00:09:15.180
300 years before the current story,&nbsp;
the Germa Kingdom was at the height&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:15.180 --> 00:09:22.140
of its power. The Germa Empire spanned the&nbsp;
entirety of the North Blue for 66 days. Ever&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:22.140 --> 00:09:27.240
since they’ve longed to grow their power to&nbsp;
something resembling this previous state.

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:32.940
200 years ago, the World Government forms&nbsp;
an alliance with Fishman Island and the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:32.940 --> 00:09:35.700
Ryugu Kingdom attended its first Reverie. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:35.700 --> 00:09:41.400
they would not attend another for another&nbsp;
200 years until the most recent Reverie.

00:09:44.100 --> 00:09:50.580
100 years ago we start to get some much more&nbsp;
familiar characters and events. With life spans&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:57.060
the way they work in the series, we’ll start to&nbsp;
see a lot of people who appear in the story or&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:57.060 --> 00:10:04.800
who get more fleshed out flashbacks relevant to&nbsp;
our main characters. And that starts with the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:04.800 --> 00:10:10.920
beginning of Dorry and Brogy’s’s duel on Little&nbsp;
Garden. This also leads to the spreading of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:15.840
Giant Warrior Pirates. Without their captains,&nbsp;
the remnants are captured by the Marines,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:21.360
but Mother Carmel convinces the Marines to let&nbsp;
them go. After returning to Elbaf with the Giants,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:21.360 --> 00:10:27.540
Mother Carmel founds the Sheep’s House&nbsp;
orphanage, a front for her slavery ring.

00:10:27.540 --> 00:10:32.220
81 years ago, we find ourselves in Wano,&nbsp;
where we’ll be spending a considerable&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:32.220 --> 00:10:37.140
amount of time for the rest of the timeline.&nbsp;
This is when the head of the Kurozumi poisoned&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:37.140 --> 00:10:41.520
the other daimyos of Wano to try and&nbsp;
attain the position of Shogun. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:41.520 --> 00:10:46.560
with the birth of Kozuki Sukiyaki,&nbsp;
the Kurozumi clan loses its power and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:46.560 --> 00:10:51.300
its members are hunted down, beginning&nbsp;
the long feud between the two houses.

00:10:51.300 --> 00:10:57.540
63 years ago, a young Charlotte LinLin is&nbsp;
abandoned by her parents on Elbaf and taken&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:57.540 --> 00:11:03.180
in by Mother Carmel. Carmel plans on selling the&nbsp;
powerful LinLin to the Marines after witnessing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:08.700
the toddler easily dispatch several fully&nbsp;
grown giants. On LInLin’s sixth birthday,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:08.700 --> 00:11:13.260
she ate a delicious croquembouche&nbsp;
with a side of Mother Carmel and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:13.260 --> 00:11:17.580
gained Carmel’s devil fruit power, the&nbsp;
Soul-Soul fruit. Together with Streusen,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:17.580 --> 00:11:22.140
who found the lone LinLin, they founded&nbsp;
Totto Land and Whole Cake Island.

00:11:22.140 --> 00:11:29.700
59 years ago, both Kozuki Oden and Kaidou&nbsp;
are born. Thus began Oden’s wild childhood&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:29.700 --> 00:11:33.720
exploits and rise in his infamous&nbsp;
reputation. During Oden’s childhood,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:33.720 --> 00:11:38.820
many other significant events happen around the&nbsp;
world as well. Shimotsuki Village is founded in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:38.820 --> 00:11:44.640
East Blue. The Rumbar pirates also befriend Laboon&nbsp;
and leave him with Crocus, before meeting their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:45.540 --> 00:11:49.680
demise in the Florian Triangle, the only&nbsp;
survivor being Brook, thanks to his devil&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:49.680 --> 00:11:54.900
fruit power. Meanwhile the giants Oimo and Kashi&nbsp;
are tricked into working for the World Government.

00:11:54.900 --> 00:12:00.480
While Oden’s notoriety increases, so does&nbsp;
Kaidou’s, with the Vodka Kingdom declaring&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:00.480 --> 00:12:04.920
him the ultimate soldier and attempting to&nbsp;
sell him to the Marines for admittance into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:04.920 --> 00:12:10.140
the Reverie. Meanwhile, while Oden is creating&nbsp;
a harem and Kaidou is escaping from the Marines,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:10.140 --> 00:12:14.820
a young Charlotte Katakuri tries&nbsp;
donuts for the first time. Soon after,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:14.820 --> 00:12:18.480
he tears open his mouth eating&nbsp;
too many of the tasty treats.

00:12:19.500 --> 00:12:23.880
44 years ago, Kaidou joined&nbsp;
the Rocks Pirates. Presumably,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:24.720 --> 00:12:29.400
other pirates such as Big Mom, join around&nbsp;
a similar time. Two years after that,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:29.400 --> 00:12:34.200
Shakky gives up pirating and starts&nbsp;
a bar on the Sabaody Archipelago.

00:12:34.200 --> 00:12:37.500
39 years ago Oden is exiled&nbsp;
from the Flower Capital,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:37.500 --> 00:12:42.300
but then he reforms Kuri and becomes&nbsp;
its new Daimyo. In the same year,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:42.300 --> 00:12:47.040
the Roger Pirates become the first&nbsp;
crew to make it to Lodestar island.

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:55.800
38 years ago, the God Valley incident occurred.&nbsp;
When the Rocks Pirates attack God Valley, home to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:55.800 --> 00:13:02.580
the Celestial Dragons, Garp and Roger join forces&nbsp;
to fight them. During the battle, Rocks dies and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:02.580 --> 00:13:08.760
God Valley completely disappears. Afterward,&nbsp;
Garp is hailed as the Hero of the Marines.

00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:20.640
5 years later, or 33 years ago, Donquixote&nbsp;
Homing gives up his position as a Celestial&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:20.640 --> 00:13:25.200
Dragon and takes his family with him from&nbsp;
Mariejois. Meanwhile, the former members of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:31.020
Rocks Pirates, Kaidou, Big Mom, and Whitebeard&nbsp;
begin recruiting members for their own crews.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:31.020 --> 00:13:36.600
Back on Wano, Inuarashi, Nekomamushi,&nbsp;
and Kawamatsu become Oden’s retainers.

00:13:37.200 --> 00:13:43.920
30 years ago, Oden meets Whitebeard and joins his&nbsp;
crew along with Neko, Inu, and Izo. While sailing,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:52.620
he also meets Toki. Meanwhile, much&nbsp;
more important to the larger story,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:52.620 --> 00:13:57.300
Monkey D. Garp punches Don Chinjao&nbsp;
so hard he rounds out his head.

00:13:57.300 --> 00:14:03.540
28 years ago, Roger discovers he has a terminal&nbsp;
illness and the Roger Pirates set out on their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:03.540 --> 00:14:09.300
final expedition through the Grand Line. The&nbsp;
same year, Nico Olvia also leaves Ohara in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:09.300 --> 00:14:14.820
search of the poneglyphs. A year later, while&nbsp;
on the Grand Line, the Roger Pirates face off&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:14.820 --> 00:14:20.100
against Shiki, and the Golden Lion is left&nbsp;
with the most unfortunate hat of all time.

00:14:20.100 --> 00:14:25.440
26 years ago, Neptune became the king of the&nbsp;
Ryugu Kingdom, Pound was kicked out of Big&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:25.440 --> 00:14:30.780
Mom’s kingdom, and young Franky - at this&nbsp;
time known as Cutty Flam - was abandoned&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:30.780 --> 00:14:35.040
by his parents. But most importantly&nbsp;
this is the year that the Whitebeard&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:35.040 --> 00:14:41.340
Pirates and Roger Pirates had a battle for&nbsp;
the ages that lasted 3 days and 3 nights.

00:14:42.240 --> 00:14:49.500
Oden joined Roger on the last leg of their&nbsp;
voyage, but meanwhile Orochi overtakes Wano&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:49.500 --> 00:14:54.000
with the backing of Kaidou and the Beast&nbsp;
Pirates. 25 years before the present story,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:54.600 --> 00:14:59.280
the Roger Pirates made it to Laugh&nbsp;
Tale. Having conquered the Grand Line,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:59.280 --> 00:15:03.840
Gol D. Roger is given the mantle of&nbsp;
the Pirate King and disbands his crew.

00:15:03.840 --> 00:15:09.300
Finally, Gol D. Roger turns himself&nbsp;
into the Marines. At his execution,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:11.880 --> 00:15:15.120
he reveals to the world the&nbsp;
knowledge of the One Piece,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:15.120 --> 00:15:22.800
inspiring hundreds of new pirates to seek his&nbsp;
hidden treasure. Thus began the Great Pirate Era.

00:15:22.800 --> 00:15:26.160
All of this history really leaves&nbsp;
us with more questions than answers,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:26.160 --> 00:15:30.780
plus there are tons of other unsolved&nbsp;
mysteries out there still to be answered,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:30.780 --> 00:15:36.660
like who is luffy’s mother, where is laugh tale&nbsp;
and what is the secret of the moon? If you crave&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:36.660 --> 00:15:43.200
an overview of all these open questions, you&nbsp;
shouldn’t miss out on this video right here.

